Hi {Owner},

I build websites for fence companies around {City}. {Business Name} has good fence and gate work on its social pages, but no site a homeowner finds when they search.

Rather than ask for your time, I built a sample first: a gallery sorted by fence style, an estimate form that asks for footage and gate count, and a page for HOA and permit questions, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it out for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
